title: Test
tags:
---
<<if not $conhasGivenTask>>
    PersonB: Hey {$player}! I have a task for you if you want it?
        -> Accept
            <<StartTask Confidant2>>
            PersonB: Awesome, thanks!
        -> Decline
            PersonB: Darn, but alright
<<else>>
   PersonB: Hope everything is going well with your task!
<<endif>>
 <<jump MenuOption>>
===

title: MenuOption
tags:
---
<<if $conisSpeaking>>
    PersonB: What would you like to do?
    -> Reset progress
        <<ResetConfidant Confidant2>>
        PersonA: I've reset our relationship data to default values.
        <<jump MenuOption>>
    -> I want to hangout with you
        <<AdvanceTimeSlot Confidant2 1>>
        <<Hangout Confidant2>>
        PersonB: That was cool.
        <<jump MenuOption>>
    -> I want discuss about your task
        PersonB: Ok, what would you want to know?
            <<if $conisTaskCompleted>>
                -> I completed the task
                    PersonB: Thank you for doing your best, I greatly appreciate it.
                    <<CompleteTask Confidant2>>
            <<else>>
                -> Nevermind
                <<jump MenuOption>>
            <<endif>>
    -> Going to leave
        PersonB: Sounds good, see ya!
        <<SaveData Confidant2>>
<<else>>
    PersonB: Got to bounce but see ya around! 
    <<SaveData Confidant2>>
    <<HideConfidant Confidant2>>
<<endif>>
===
